  "fullDescription": "THE OPEN PLANNER — an undated digital planner built to hold every part of your life in one calm, minimalist system. Finance, lifestyle, wellness, self care, productivity, and career — 66 hyperlinked pages, designed to work for 2027 and every year after.\n\nNo dates to waste, no pages to outgrow. Start on any month, any year, and keep using it for as long as you like.\n\nWHAT’S INSIDE\n– Calendar — year at a glance, 12 monthly spreads, 4 weekly templates, 2 daily templates\n– Finance — monthly budget, expense log, savings goal tracker, debt payoff tracker, bill checklist\n– Lifestyle — weekly meal planner, grocery list, travel planner, home maintenance, gift planner\n– Wellness — habit tracker, water tracker, sleep tracker, workout log, mood tracker\n– Self Care — AM/PM skincare routine, self-care menu, gratitude journal, affirmations, rest day planner\n– Productivity — daily to-do, weekly priorities, project planner, 30-day challenge, brain dump\n– Career — goals & vision, job application tracker, meeting notes, professional development, networking log\n– Extras — lined/dot/blank notes, password tracker, contacts, year in review\n– 6 alternate cover designs — swap in a new look any time, in the same neutral colour family\n– A full sticker sheet — 44 stickers to decorate and personalise your pages\n\nHOW IT WORKS\n– Fully undated — every calendar page is left blank so you can start any month, any year\n– Hyperlinked navigation — tap any coloured side tab to jump straight to that section from anywhere in the file, and tap “Home” in the footer to return to the main menu\n– Duplicate what you need — weekly and daily pages are provided as templates; most annotation apps let you copy a page as many times as one year needs\n– One PDF, 66 pages, sized for US Letter — use it digitally or print it at home\n\nCOVERS & STICKERS — HOW TO USE THEM\n– Alternate covers: each of the 6 covers is its own single-page PDF. In GoodNotes or Notability, open your planner, delete the current cover page, then import the cover PDF you want and insert it as page 1 — swap it again any time you fancy a refresh.\n– Sticker sheet (printable): print the sticker sheet page(s) at 100% on sticker paper, then cut around each design for physical stickers to use alongside a printed planner.\n– Sticker PNGs (digital): each sticker is also included as an individual transparent PNG. In GoodNotes, add them via Add Image/Stamp and save your favourites to your Stamps toolbar; in Notability, import them as stickers in the Gallery. Resize, rotate, and reuse them on any page.\n\nWORKS WITH\nGoodNotes, Notability, Xodo, Adobe Acrobat Reader, Noteshelf, or any PDF annotation app on tablet or laptop. Also prints beautifully on US Letter paper for a paper-planner experience.\n\nWHAT YOU’LL RECEIVE\n– 1 main planner PDF, 66 pages, hyperlinked with a full bookmark outline, sized for US Letter (8.5″ x 11″)\n– 6 alternate cover PDFs, same page size, ready to swap in\n– 1 printable sticker sheet PDF (44 stickers)\n– 1 zip file of 44 individual transparent PNG stickers, sorted by type, for GoodNotes/Notability\n– Instant digital download — no physical item will be shipped\n\nPLEASE NOTE — PERSONAL USE ONLY\nThis is a digital product for personal, non-commercial use only. Please do not resell, redistribute, share, or repost this file — as-is or edited — in any free or paid product. Because this is an instant digital download, all sales are final; no refunds once the file has been delivered. Questions or an issue with your download? Send a message any time — I’m happy to help.\n\nThank you for supporting a small shop!",
